  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release 2.3.0: Google Speech-to-Text Integration\n\n✨ New Features:\n• Google Speech-to-Text integration with enterprise-grade speech recognition\n• Support for 100+ languages including Turkish, English, and global languages\n• Real-time audio processing with advanced speech-to-text conversion\n• Detailed transcription results with timestamps and confidence metrics\n• Automatic format detection for MP3, WAV, M4A, AAC, OGG, FLAC, WMA\n• Intelligent audio processing with smart validation and error handling\n• Performance optimized audio processing with minimal memory footprint\n\n🔧 Technical Improvements:\n• Enhanced audio processing pipeline with Google Cloud AI\n• Updated configuration management with GoogleSpeechConfig\n• Improved error handling for audio transcription operations\n• Comprehensive XML documentation for all public APIs\n• Zero warnings policy compliance with SOLID/DRY principles\n• Structured audio output for searchable, queryable knowledge base\n\n📚 Documentation Updates:\n• Comprehensive audio processing feature documentation\n• Enhanced README with detailed speech-to-text capabilities\n• Updated all language versions (EN, TR, DE, RU) with examples\n• Added multi-language support documentation for global applications\n• Better developer experience with detailed audio processing examples\n• Complete API documentation with XML summaries",
